{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":110207,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2eNbM0DKemzJGxYzUv4gL3qgxa5.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2431563","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Five years ago, the Global Synchronic Urban Disappearance claimed the lives of Seria's family. A ticket to a new, hologram-enhanced style of theater opens Seria's eyes to a new world of possibilities, if she can muster the courage to take the next step.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mPzBKqehfTTN4RD5bEz1zVHfJnd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mPzBKqehfTTN4RD5bEz1zVHfJnd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"2615297","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Seria returns to Alice in Theater to pursue her acting dreams. However, the girls of Alice In encounter an unexpected problem. They'll have to find a way to raise more money if they want to make it in the theater business.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vGJFOo1eBCbnIThTZcBgdkB4pUz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vGJFOo1eBCbnIThTZcBgdkB4pUz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"2615298","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Airi is haunted by her past. In order to continue in Alice in Theater, she must find a way to reconcile her feelings.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wfW2L3w3b1yaxf4DfXlXP36xW3h.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wfW2L3w3b1yaxf4DfXlXP36xW3h.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"2615299","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After a successful closing night, Alice in Theater begins preparing for its next production. As Seria polishes her acting skills, the anniversary of the Global Synchronic Disappearance arrives.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ifXL8l5eW53pFS3Kl4ZoLTzM5JC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ifXL8l5eW53pFS3Kl4ZoLTzM5JC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"2615301","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After celebrating Seria's birthday, preparations continue for Alice in Deadly School. A surprise development throws a wrench in the troupe's plans. Can they find a solution to the problem so close to opening night?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nwXUFVUIzq2eDqmKtPNvTRcukRv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nwXUFVUIzq2eDqmKtPNvTRcukRv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"2615302","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"アリスをいずみと見間違えて駆け寄ろうとし、階段から落ちてしまったあいり。1か月は舞台に立てなくなったあいりは、せりあに代役を頼む。自分の演技はモノマネだとうなだれるせりあに、あいりは「本物にしてあげる」と意気込み、厳しい稽古を続けていく。そんな舞台をいずみと竹崎が見にやってきて……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uLyIrwVUN4QZxUW8hJvYsd3kUnX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uLyIrwVUN4QZxUW8hJvYsd3kUnX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"2615303","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シアトリカルマテリアルシステムの故障により、3か月の休演を余儀なくされていたアリスインシアター。再開のめどが立つと、かをるは次作を『降臨武闘少女（バトルガール）』に決め、あいりとせりあをダブル主演に指名する。それを見ていた劇団創設メンバーの晃と愛美は、自分たちはかをるに必要とされていないのでは……と考えていた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7v6cXUdrwq9CZPGk0JJJ6ojuv0P.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7v6cXUdrwq9CZPGk0JJJ6ojuv0P.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"2615305","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"アリスインシアターからいなくなったドールは、スーパーマテリアルシアター（SMT）の竹崎の元にいた。竹崎はSMTの次回公演の主役をドールにすると言う。ショックを受けたいずみがあいりの部屋を訪れると、そこにはせりあもいた。いずみとあいりはお互いに本音をぶつけ合って和解。いずみはSMTを取り戻すと誓う。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yA8P0Cu3R5EwKTPzUgD4eKw77Le.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yA8P0Cu3R5EwKTPzUgD4eKw77Le.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"2615306","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"かをるが姿を消した。すでにアリスインシアターが入る建物の所有権を得ていた竹崎は、出入口を閉鎖し、団員の出入りを禁止。アリスインシアターは休団となってしまう。しかし、晃たちはあきらめていなかった。ほかの劇場を借りるために資金を集めようと、ゲキドル活動を再開。そこにせりあがいずみを連れてやってくる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bRSenz4h9tt1pgqJcR0wUsaFEz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bRSenz4h9tt1pgqJcR0wUsaFEz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"2615307","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"真琴の父親が理事長をしていた学校を劇場とし、アリスインシアターは新たなスタートを切った。シアトリカルマテリアルシステムもなく、衣装もセットも手作り。それでも客入りは上々で、次は新作を上演することに。題材は、いずみがかをるの部屋で見つけた「妄想日記」。脚本を担当する愛美は、主人公のミキ役にせりあを推薦する。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3RP0gwgPg28E3XzNthz4Xyzsjig.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3RP0gwgPg28E3XzNthz4Xyzsjig.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"2615308","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"時空を監視し、過去に介入するイノヴェイター。かをるはそれを追跡するゲイザーのひとりだった。「妄想日記」は、かをるの同僚・キョウコが綴ったものだったのだ。そうとは知らないせりあたちは、『クロノゲイザー』の幕を上げる。その頃、竹崎は自分の理想である争いのない世界を実現するべく動いていた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/geZWRYq1k3PhfiP0EuC6wXXaaiG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/geZWRYq1k3PhfiP0EuC6wXXaaiG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"2615310","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"グランドマテリアルシステムが起動すると、人々はヒモのようになって消滅していく。周囲の景色までもが変わり、晃たちが動揺する中、それでも『クロノゲイザー』の舞台を続けていくせりあとあいり、いずみ。一方、意識を取り戻したかをるは、そこでかつて殺したはずの梓と再会する。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A3C5sVaEuPOjJVO0u3jgjXeA1W2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A3C5sVaEuPOjJVO0u3jgjXeA1W2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110207/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793440891416,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}}}
